{
  "id": "103",
  "title": "Answering the Phone",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-03-19",
  "synopsis": "Do you often get unwanted sales calls? In this funny story, we see one way of dealing with a call from an insurance company.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/89/134cbd43e655f40fe5c10ecf66998125fef5ec43.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "接电话\n\n刚才接到一个电话。\n我说：“喂，你好，哪位？”\n“我是保险公司的，请问您开车吗？”\n我想了想，说：“我不开，司机开。”\n“您去哪儿？”\n我回答：“去北京。”\n“您的车有保险吗？”\n我回答：“应该有吧，我等会儿问问。”\n“您坐的车值多少钱呢？”\n我回答：“没问过，应该有几千万吧。”\n“那么贵，您的是什么车呀？”\n我回答：“火车呀。”\n对方马上把电话挂了。我说错什么了吗？",
    "traditional": "接電話\n\n剛才接到一個電話。\n我說：“喂，你好，哪位？”\n“我是保險公司的，請問您開車嗎？”\n我想了想，說：“我不開，司機開。”\n“您去哪兒？”\n我回答：“去北京。”\n“您的車有保險嗎？”\n我回答：“應該有吧，我等會兒問問。”\n“您坐的車值多少錢呢？”\n我回答：“沒問過，應該有幾千萬吧。”\n“那麼貴，您的是什麼車呀？”\n我回答：“火車呀。”\n對方馬上把電話掛了。我說錯什麼了嗎？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Answering the Phone"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "刚才接到一个电话。",
      "traditional": "剛才接到一個電話。",
      "pinyin": "gāng cái jiē dào yí ge diàn huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Just a moment ago I got a phone call."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我说：“喂，你好，哪位？”",
      "traditional": "我說：“喂，你好，哪位？”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shuō wéi nǐ hǎo nǎ wèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I said: “Hello, who is it?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“我是保险公司的，请问您开车吗？”",
      "traditional": "“我是保險公司的，請問您開車嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shì bǎo xiǎn gōng sī de qǐng wèn nín kāi chē ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“I'm calling from an insurance company. May I ask if you drive a car?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我想了想，说：“我不开，司机开。”",
      "traditional": "我想了想，說：“我不開，司機開。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng le xiǎng shuō wǒ bù kāi sī jī kāi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I thought for a bit, then said: “I don't, the driver does.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "“您去哪儿？”",
      "traditional": "“您去哪兒？”",
      "pinyin": "nín qù nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Where are you going?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "我回答：“去北京。”",
      "traditional": "我回答：“去北京。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ huí dá qù běi jīng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I replied: “To Beijing.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "“您的车有保险吗？”",
      "traditional": "“您的車有保險嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "nín de chē yǒu bǎo xiǎn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Does the car have insurance?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "我回答：“应该有吧，我等会儿问问。”",
      "traditional": "我回答：“應該有吧，我等會兒問問。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ huí dá yīng gāi yǒu ba wǒ děng huì'r wèn wen",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I replied: “I'm sure it does, I'll ask in a bit.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "“您坐的车值多少钱呢？”",
      "traditional": "“您坐的車值多少錢呢？”",
      "pinyin": "nín zuò de chē zhí duō shao qián ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“How much is the car worth?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "我回答：“没问过，应该有几千万吧。”",
      "traditional": "我回答：“沒問過，應該有幾千萬吧。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ huí dá méi wèn guò yīng gāi yǒu jǐ qiān wàn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I replied: “I haven't asked, but it must be tens of millions.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "“那么贵，您的是什么车呀？”",
      "traditional": "“那麼貴，您的是什麼車呀？”",
      "pinyin": "nà me guì nín de shì shén me chē ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“That expensive? What kind of car is it?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "我回答：“火车呀。”",
      "traditional": "我回答：“火車呀。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ huí dá huǒ chē ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I replied: “It's a train car.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "simplified": "对方马上把电话挂了。",
      "traditional": "對方馬上把電話掛了。",
      "pinyin": "duì fāng mǎ shàng bǎ diàn huà guà le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "simplified": "我说错什么了吗？",
      "traditional": "我說錯什麼了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shuō cuò shén me le ma",
      "english": "The other person immediately hung up the phone."
    }
  ],
